.\" -*- mode: nroff -*-
.TH MIMO-VOICE 1 "2026-07-03" "mimo-voice 0.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mimo-voice \- quick voice switcher for MiMo TTS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mimo-voice
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ voice-name ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mimo-voice
is a command-line tool for switching voices of the Xiaomi MiMo TTS
speech-dispatcher module. It reads and writes the
.I MIMO_VOICE
setting in the config file and restarts speech-dispatcher to apply changes.
.PP
Config file lookup order:
.RS 4
.I ~/.config/speech-dispatcher/mimo-tts.env
(user, preferred)
.RE
.RS 4
.I /etc/speech-dispatcher/mimo-tts.env
(system fallback)
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-list
List all available voices with descriptions.
.TP
.BR \-s " NAME, " \-\-set " NAME"
Switch to the specified voice.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-test
Speak a test phrase using the current voice.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-current
Print the current voice name.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show usage information.
.SH VOICES
.SS Chinese
.TS
l l.
mimo_default	Default female
冰糖	Sweet female
茉莉	Gentle female
苏打	Lively male
白桦	Calm male
.TE
.SS English
.TS
l l.
Mia	Female
Chloe	Female
Milo	Male
Dean	Male
.TE
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
List voices:
.RS 4
.B mimo-voice \-\-list
.RE
.PP
Switch to 冰糖:
.RS 4
.B mimo-voice \-\-set 冰糖
.RE
.PP
Short form:
.RS 4
.B mimo-voice 冰糖
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/speech-dispatcher/mimo-tts.env
User config (preferred).
.TP
.I /etc/speech-dispatcher/mimo-tts.env
System config (fallback).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR spd-say (1),
.BR speech-dispatcher (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Written by jo.
